  "description": "Adventure Gravel Road - Dominate rough Roads and even Light Trails: This Turino Elite Disc brake road bike can do it all. Adventure, Gravel, Endurance design means higher headtubes for a bit more upright and comfortable riding positions.\n\nComes with 700x40c Maxxis tires, capable of using up to 700x48c* to dominate gravel roads. Or use a narrow 700x28c for maximum speed on your commute. Laugh and float over rough roads, chipseal, gravel, up to light trails and revel in your powerful disc brakes through virtually all weather conditions.\n\nPerfect for the sport to advanced level athlete wanting the performance of an aluminum frame, coupled with the precision and handling of a Carbon fork and dealing with a budget. This model has Shimano Claris Aluminum cranks for hill-crushing performance at a lighter weight.",
